<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσβᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβαίνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>means of approach,
			access</i>, esp. uphill, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεσι, ἔνθα π. οὐδεμίαν εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.111
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				489
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.96
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				7.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβάσεις τεκμαίρεται
			πύργων</span> looks for <i>means of scaling</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				180
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐκ θαλάττης π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.56.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>accession</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ εὖ ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.178
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>rise</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν Νειλῴων ὑδάτων
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				2 ii 22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
